1
00:00:00,515 --> 00:00:02,485
(Sheldon:)I think we should
see other people.

2
00:00:05,353 --> 00:00:06,283
What?!

3
00:00:06,285 --> 00:00:09,425
(Sheldon:)Well, as a male, I have
an evolutionary drive

4
00:00:09,424 --> 00:00:11,194
(Sheldon:)to perpetuate my DNA.

5
00:00:11,192 --> 00:00:14,932
(Sheldon:)Restricting myself to a single
partner is against my nature.

6
00:00:16,598 --> 00:00:18,298
We sleep together once a year!

7
00:00:18,299 --> 00:00:20,829
(Amy:)You want other partners?

8
00:00:20,835 --> 00:00:23,765
(Sheldon:)Don't blame me.
Blame your pal, biology.

9
00:00:23,771 --> 00:00:26,301
(Sheldon:)He's the pervert pulling
the strings here.

10
00:00:27,308 --> 00:00:29,858
(Amy:)You wanna see other people?
Go see other people.

11
00:00:30,291 --> 00:00:33,611
(Penny:)I hope one of those people is a
monkey, 'cause this is bananas.

12
00:00:34,892 --> 00:00:36,552
(Leonard:)You can make jokes,
but if this keeps up,

13
00:00:36,557 --> 00:00:37,767
(Leonard:)he's gonna move
back in here.

14
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:39,557
(Penny:)All right. Well, let's just get them
apart for a while

15
00:00:39,554 --> 00:00:40,564
(Penny:)so they can cool down.

16
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:41,460
(Leonard:)Good.

17
00:00:41,456 --> 00:00:43,026
(Leonard:)Then before we
reintroduce them,

18
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:44,224
(Leonard:)we'll give him one
of her sweaters

19
00:00:44,225 --> 00:00:46,725
(Leonard:)so he can get used
to her scent again.

20
00:00:47,721 --> 00:00:50,331
(Penny:)So it's okay for you
to joke around?

21
00:00:50,331 --> 00:00:51,931
(Leonard:)No, that's actually
what we did with him

22
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:54,063
(Leonard:)when Howard came
back from space.

23
00:00:56,271 --> 00:01:02,021
(Howard:)Honey, how ya feeling?

